{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120237","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120237/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120237/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120237/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120237","id":4648609141,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFRQldQ","number":120237,"title":"MCP to help OSS devs understand godotengine/godot","user":{"login":"ankitzm","id":66105983,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1OTgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105983?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitzm","html_url":"https://github.com/ankitzm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitzm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitzm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitzm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitzm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitzm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitzm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitzm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitzm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ankitzm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6051509301,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaLK0NQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/spam","name":"spam","color":"E94A26","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-06-12T10:53:14Z","updated_at":"2026-06-12T10:53:49Z","closed_at":"2026-06-12T10:53:37Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":"spam","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hey godotengine/godot folks,\n\ngodot is a big codebase, and I noticed newcomers are mostly confused about where to start. Digging through codebase through any AI agent will burn a lot of tokens for simplest task as it uses complete repo context.\n\nI maintain [bytebell/open-ir](https://github.com/ByteBell/open-ir), an open-source tool that builds a cross-repo dependency + call graph of a codebase and serves it over MCP so devs can just *ask* how the code fits together.\n\nQuick demo (MCP in action):\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c24b0b81-c618-4f15-a3a7-b0de25894563\n\nIf this post gets 15+ 👍 from maintainers/devs, I'll index godot and stand up a free hosted MCP endpoint for contributors.\n\nWhat this is and isn't:\n- It helps contributors understand the code and answer their questions on codebase.\n- It does NOT auto-file issues or PRs. Nothing touches your tracker.\n- Free for the project, completely opt-in\n- Reduces the overhead of juggling through files.\n- Helps AI agent to generate code with better context\n\nIf that's interesting I'm happy to run it for the OSS community for `godotengine/godot`.\n— Ankit Singh","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/f